--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,23 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## [v0.1.37-test.1] - 2026-11-26
+
+> R50 E2LB 0x4300 A/B recovery candidate. The automatic fallback is triggered only by a written DUAL_GROUP request followed by a peer-initiated iAP2 restart before 0x4301; it does not prove causation or claim a vehicle fix.
+
+### English
+- Separate peer ACK-only frames from peer payload frames in 0x4300 startup diagnostics.
+- Distinguish not-transmitted, local-write-incomplete, transport-ACKed-without-0x4301, ACK-only activity, payload activity, and peer-link termination.
+- When an explicitly enabled E2LB DUAL_GROUP request was locally written and the receiver then restarts iAP2 before 0x4301, remember a receiver-fingerprint-scoped SINGLE_GROUP fallback for the next attempt.
+- A manual change of the DUAL_GROUP setting clears the remembered fallback and starts a fresh A/B experiment. No other receiver is affected.
+- Preserve wire format, MFi behavior, and retransmission policy; real-vehicle outcome remains unverified.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 在 0x4300 启动诊断中分开统计车机纯 ACK 帧与带载荷数据帧。
+- 分别识别未发送、本地写入未完成、仅链路 ACK、仅 ACK 活动、数据活动及对端链路结束。
+- 对明确启用 DUAL_GROUP 的 E2LB，如果 0x4300 已完成本地写入，随后车机在 0x4301 前主动重启 iAP2，则按车机指纹记住下一轮使用 SINGLE_GROUP。
+- 用户手动切换 DUAL_GROUP 开关会清除自动回退记录，重新开始 A/B 实验；不影响其它车机。
+- 不改变报文格式、MFi 行为或重传策略；实车结果仍待验证。
+
 ## [v0.1.36-test.1] - 2026-11-26
 
 > R49 identity-boundary hardening candidate. No E2LB/iAP2 connection fix claimed.
